  "description": "Fast, low-allocation HTML/XML parser for web scraping on .NET 9/10/11. About 10x (up to 30x) faster and 12–23x less memory than AngleSharp and HtmlAgilityPack in benchmarks. XPath 1.0 and CSS selectors, zero-allocation tag/attribute matching, HTML5 entities, clean HTML to text extraction, HTML to Markdown.",
